% backend: none
% expect-error: rangecheck
% oracle: skip the reference implements shading patterns
% Scenario: a shading pattern is out of range. A PatternType of 2 is
% refused by makepattern with rangecheck: only tiling patterns exist.
<< /PatternType 2 /Shading << /ShadingType 2 >> >> [1 0 0 1 0 0] makepattern
